=== layout: two-panels

# Keeping Quiz 5: The Tradeoff

@left

## Benefits

- Group quizzes are easier to do well on and can boost your grade.
- Another quiz helps you prepare for the Final Exam.

@right

## Cost

- You have to study for another quiz.

